  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across a variety of categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\uded2 Best Laptop Deals Online (June 2026)\n\n### \ud83c\udfec Where to Shop\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and so on. It's also worth checking out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbb Top Picks by Category\n\n#### \u2b50 Best Overall / Premium Laptop\n**Lenovo Yoga (2-in-1)**\nFeaturing a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with HDR and up to 120Hz, powered by an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU**, 32GB of RAM, 1TB SSD, and Intel Arc 140V graphics. It weighs under three pounds, offers up to **23 hours of battery life**, and flips all the way around so you can use it like a tablet or prop it up like a tent.\n\n---\n\n#### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Laptops\nTop gaming options at Best Buy include:\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** \u2013 16\" 2.5K OLED, 240Hz, Intel Core Ultra 9 285H, **NVIDIA RTX 5070**, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14** \u2013 14\" 3K OLED, 120Hz, AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX, **NVIDIA RTX 5080**, 32GB RAM, 2TB SSD\n- **Lenovo Legion Pro 5** \u2013 16\" 2.5K, AMD Ryzen 9 8945HX, **NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060**, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD\n\nThere's also a standout deal on an **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** with an OLED display, Ultra 7 chipset, 32GB of RAM, and **$400 off**.\n\n---\n\n#### \ud83d\udcbc Best Budget Laptop\n**Dell 15 Laptop**\nThe **Dell 15 Laptop** is a great affordable pick \u2014 its AMD Ryzen 3 7320U chip is well suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n---\n\n#### \ud83d\udd04 Best 2-in-1 Laptops (Best Buy)\nNotable 2-in-1 deals include:\n- **HP OmniBook X Flip** \u2013 16\" 2K OLED Touchscreen, Intel Core Ultra 5, 16GB Memory, 512GB SSD (Copilot+)\n- **Lenovo Yoga 7a** \u2013 14\" 2K OLED Touchscreen, AMD Ryzen AI 7 445, 24GB Memory, 512GB SSD (Copilot+ PC)\n\n---\n\n#### \ud83c\udf10 Best Chromebooks\nAffordable Chromebook options include:\n- **Acer Chromebook 315** \u2013 15.6\" FHD, MediaTek Kompanio 540, 4GB Memory, from 64GB Storage\n- **Lenovo Chromebook Plus** \u2013 15.3\" 2K Touchscreen, Intel Core 3 N355, 8GB Memory, 128GB UFS\n\nChromebooks make great everyday machines as they're designed for browsing the web and checking email, use fewer resources, and are generally more affordable than Windows laptops.\n\n---\n\n#### \ud83c\udf4e Best MacBook Deal\nYou can **save up to $300 on the Apple MacBook Air** \u2014 with two unmissable deals available on the **M4 and M5** models.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Shopping Tips\n- Whether you're looking for an affordable Windows machine **under $500**, a blazing fast gaming beast, or a portable 2-in-1 for school or work, there are plenty of great choices right now.\n- You'll want at least **8GB of RAM** (16GB is preferable if you play games). Avoid laptops with under 4GB of RAM or 128GB of SSD storage.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd17 Best Places to Browse Deals:\n| Retailer | Link |\n|---|---|\n| **Best Buy** | [bestbuy.com](https://www.bestbuy.com/site/all-computers-tablets-on-sale/laptops-on-sale/pcmcat1720704669400.c) |\n| **HP Store** | [hp.com](https://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/slp/weekly-deals/laptops) |\n| **PCWorld Deals** | [pcworld.com](https://www.pcworld.com/article/550968/best-laptop-deals-3.html) |\n| **TechRadar Deals** | [techradar.com](https://www.techradar.com/news/the-best-laptop-deals) |\n| **BestLaptop.deals** | [bestlaptop.deals](https://www.bestlaptop.deals/) |\n\nHappy shopping! Let me know if you'd like deals tailored to a specific budget or use case. \ud83d\ude0a",
